Real YANG used by component_sameconfig_realyang_test.go
=======================================================

These five files are verbatim copies (cp -p, byte-identical) of the YANG that
ships in the image. They are what the sameConfig tests need: the import closure
of vyatta-system-acm-v1 plus the module that augments it:

  vyatta-system-acm-configd-v1
                        imports  vyatta-system-v1, vyatta-system-acm-v1, configd-v1
                        and augments /system:system/system-acm:acm with
                        ruleset, rpc-ruleset, notification-ruleset, ... -- the
                        nodes the tests actually exercise. vyatta-system-acm-v1
                        itself only defines an EMPTY acm container.
  vyatta-system-acm-v1  imports  vyatta-system-v1, configd-v1
  vyatta-system-v1      imports  configd-v1, ietf-yang-types
  configd-v1            imports  (nothing)
  ietf-yang-types       imports  (nothing)

Nothing outside these five is imported or needed.

file                        source repo @ commit                                      path in repo
--------------------------  --------------------------------------------------------  ------------
vyatta-system-acm-configd-v1.yang  configd @ efe5b6a7dc1a621f3bc203bbba96456b8f57787b  yang/
vyatta-system-acm-v1.yang   vyatta-cfg @ d82bdad665c6f744f0db3d29b0c0b3aab55b9a6c      yang/
vyatta-system-v1.yang       vyatta-cfg @ d82bdad665c6f744f0db3d29b0c0b3aab55b9a6c      yang/
configd-v1.yang             configd    @ efe5b6a7dc1a621f3bc203bbba96456b8f57787b      yang/
ietf-yang-types.yang        configd    @ efe5b6a7dc1a621f3bc203bbba96456b8f57787b      yang/

