  ietf-yang-types.yang:
      IETF Trust and the persons identified as authors (Simplified BSD, per the
      IETF Trust Legal Provisions); AT&T-modified copy as shipped in configd.

Regenerate (from the danos-sources directory, with both repos checked out at the
commits above):

  D=config/schema/testdata/realyang
  cp -p vyatta-cfg/yang/vyatta-system-acm-v1.yang vyatta-cfg/yang/vyatta-system-v1.yang $D/
  cp -p configd/yang/configd-v1.yang configd/yang/ietf-yang-types.yang \
     configd/yang/vyatta-system-acm-configd-v1.yang $D/

This directory is deliberately separate from testdata/yang, which
namespace_map_test.go compiles and counts components in; do not merge them.
